nderstood! I'll thoroughly explore all aspects of extension development for Visual Studio, including:\n\n1. **Extension Basics**:\n   - Understanding the **Visual Studio Extensibility Model**.\n   - Setting up a Visual Studio extension project.\n\n2. **Core Features**:\n   - Adding custom commands, menus, and tool windows.\n   - Integrating with the **IDE's code editor and debugging tools**.\n\n3. **Advanced Functionality**:\n   - Using the **Visual Studio SDK APIs** for file handling, syntax highlighting, and code completion.\n   - Leveraging **Roslyn APIs** for analyzing and manipulating code dynamically.\n\n4. **Customizing User Experience**:\n   - Creating WPF-based UI components for the extension.\n   - Handling events and live updates within the extension environment.\n\n5. **Integration**:\n   - Managing dependencies with **NuGet**.\n   - Seamless integration with version control systems like **Git**.\n\n6. **Testing and Deployment**:\n   - Testing extensions within the **Experimental Instance of Visual Studio**.\n   - Packaging and publishing extensions to the **Visual Studio Marketplace**.\n\nLet me know when you’re ready to start, and I’ll guide us step by step in building your extension! 🚀"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[],"content_references":[],"gizmo_id":"g-p-67602e091f74819198d390981dd99ebf","message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"gpt-4o","parent_id":"aaa2dee2-e600-4116-91a7-3942a9226870","request_id":"8f2f5bc63c31eb61-ORD","timestamp_":"absolute","model_switcher_deny":[{"slug":"gpt-5-2-pro","context":"regenerate","reason":"unsupported_canvas","is_available":true,"description":"This model doesn't support canvas."},{"slug":"gpt-5-2-pro","context":"conversation","reason":"unsupported_canvas","is_available":true,"description":"This model doesn't support canvas."},{"slug":"gpt-5-1-pro","context":"regene